diff --git a/cloud/BNS-URL-PREVIEW.txt b/cloud/BNS-URL-PREVIEW.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..289bc8c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/cloud/BNS-URL-PREVIEW.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+BNS URL quote preview — offline integration companion
+
+The live offer chat keeps the selected marketplace URL and seller grade labels.
+A URL preview resolves that server-held URL through BNS and requests at most one
+single-item/quantity-one quote. It does not establish a catalog priceable unit,
+PSA verification, certificate authentication or the physical card's identity.
+
+No provider access is enabled by this change. Existing BNS/PSA flags remain off.
+No order, checkout or payment operation exists in the commerce route allowlist.
+No runtime/release pins or deployment configuration are changed.
+
+When BNS access is independently provisioned and testing is authorized, the
+managed private staging sidecar has a second explicit configuration opt-in:
+  POKEMON_COMMERCE_BNS_ENABLED=true
+  POKEMON_COMMERCE_BNS_URL_PREVIEW=true
+The three existing BNS_PARTNER_BASE_URL, BNS_PARTNER_CLIENT_ID and
+BNS_PARTNER_CLIENT_SECRET values must come from approved server-side secrets.
+Do not place credentials in this document, the browser, source or PR evidence.
+The sidecar then passes --allow-live-buyship --buyship-url-preview.
+POKEMON_COMMERCE_QUOTE_DB must be absent in this mode. The legacy indexed path
+remains BNS_ENABLED=true plus QUOTE_DB and passes --quote-db without URL preview.
+Fixture mode cannot be mixed with either provider mode or credentials.
+
+The UI displays normalized refusal codes/reasons, static messages, safe currency
+and field hints. It never displays provider-authored error text or secret-bearing
+metadata, and it never retries automatically. Multiple variants require a fresh,
+explicit choice of an in-stock variant before a new handoff request. The request
+contains only variant_key in addition to selection_id, forwarder and destination.
+The backend owns URL/reference/price binding and re-resolves before quoting.
+
+Choices are invalidated when the offer, research, forwarder, destination or
+returned variant options/price/stock change. Unsupported and sold-out variants
+remain visible and cannot be selected. The informational product URL can still
+be copied after a refusal; this is not evidence that BNS accepts that product.
+
+URL previews show the source item ask, BNS-resolved item price, delivered provider
+total and expiry separately. Same-currency differences receive a warning; unlike
+currencies are not compared. Grade, identity and authenticity remain unverified.
+Legacy indexed previews keep their existing presentation and validation path.
+
+Offline validation:
+  node --test creator/tests/bns-url-preview.test.cjs creator/tests/pokemon-commerce-loop.test.cjs creator/tests/private-commerce-staging.test.cjs
+  ./creator/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit -p creator/tsconfig.json
+
+No live marketplace/BNS/PSA calls, deployment, orders or payments are needed for
+these tests. The sidecar tests inject process/HTTP doubles without network access.
